,"Standard":"Standardno","Expert":"Strokovnjak","Minimal Touch":"Minimalen dotik","Reach the base with a tight rotation budget.":"Dosezite bazo s tesnim rotacijskim proračunom.","Speedrun Spiral":"Speedrun spirala","Beat the clock to the base.":"Premagajte uro do dna.","Needlework":"Ročno delo","Very narrow gaps. Precision is everything.":"Zelo ozke reže. Natančnost je vse.","Drift Storm":"Nihajni vihar","Every layer drifts. Read the motion.":"Vsaka plast se premika. Preberi predlog.","The Long Drop":"Dolga kapljica","Forty layers. Endurance and nerve.":"Štirideset plasti. Vzdržljivost in živci.","Breaker":"Razbijač","Danger everywhere — chain drops to smash through.":"Nevarnost povsod — veriga pade, da jo prebiješ.","Rotate the Tower":"Zavrtite stolp","The tower turns; the ball does not. Rotate left and right with ←/→, A/D, the on-screen arrows, or by dragging.":"Stolp se obrne; žoga ne. Zasukajte levo in desno z ←/→, A/D, puščicami na zaslonu ali z vlečenjem.","Find the Gap":"Poišči vrzel","Line the glowing gap up with the ball and it drops through. Pass every layer to reach the base.":"Obložite žarečo režo s kroglico in pade skoznjo. Prehodite vsako plast, da dosežete osnovo.","Danger Sectors":"Nevarni sektorji","Striped sectors are dangerous. Never land on one — rotate past them before you drop.":"Črtasti sektorji so nevarni. Nikoli ne pristani na enem — zavrti mimo njih, preden padeš.","Combos":"Kombinacije","Drop through several layers without landing for bonus points. Aligned gaps make a shaft — release and fall!":"Spustite se skozi več plasti brez pristanka za dodatne točke. Poravnane reže tvorijo gred — sprostite in padite!","Smash Through":"Prebij skozi","Pass 3 layers in one drop and the ball charges up — the next danger sector shatters instead of stopping you.":"Prehodite 3 plasti naenkrat in žoga se napolni - naslednji nevarni sektor se razbije, namesto da bi vas ustavil.","Cancel":"Prekliči","Erase":"Izbriši","Key bindings":"Vezave tipk","Open Options":"Odprite možnosti","Progress erased.":"Napredek izbrisan.","Progress restored from your StarHermit cloud save.":"Napredek obnovljen iz vašega shranjevanja v oblak StarHermit.","Run over":"Povožen","Volumes, mute, graphics quality, language, larger text, high contrast and reduced motion are in the StarHermit Options.":"Glasnost, izklop zvoka, kakovost grafike, jezik, večje besedilo, visok kontrast in zmanjšano gibanje so v možnostih StarHermit."}
